{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡熱傳一段港鐵車廂短片，有網民直擊一名坐在港鐵座位上的乘客，竟公然脫下鞋襪、赤腳架起單腿，旁若無人地用手指不斷重複摳捽腳趾縫。影片曝光後迅速震撼網絡，引發大批市民對公共交通衛生與公德心的強烈討論。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-01-12h32m37s517.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265v6KZMiQlZ1788237493.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-01-12h32m37s517.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">不少網民對此等不文明行為大感無奈與離譜，紛紛留言嘲諷：「捽完有冇聞？」、「返屋企先做啦！」、「真係當咗自己屋企」亦有網民深感惡心並直指公共衛生隱患，憂心忡忡表示：「捽完再摸扶手，下一手食到正！」、「會唔會傳播香港腳？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T04:58:37.254938+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}